    <string name="about_features">Features</string>
    <string name="about_features_txt">• Video &amp; music player with background play, floating player, resume, A-B repeat, speed control, equalizer and bass boost\n• Privacy lock for hidden files (fingerprint/biometric)\n• Recycle bin, favorites, history and playlists\n• Downloads and a built-in browser\n• Network stream and screen cast\n• Video to audio converter\n• File transfer over Wi-Fi\n• Media manager\n• 46 wallpaper themes with swipe preview, transparent mode and text colours\n• English and Bangla\n• Home screen widget</string>
    <string name="about_new">What\'s new</string>
    <string name="about_new_txt">Version 1.0\n• 46 new wallpaper themes\n• Swipe through themes and tap Use\n• Boxes and borders turn fully transparent on wallpaper themes\n• New Text colour tab\n• Expanded About us page</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_txt">• HM player has no account or sign-in.\n• Your videos, music and files stay on your device. Nothing is uploaded.\n• The app has no ads and includes no analytics or tracking libraries.\n• The internet is used only for things you open yourself: the browser, downloads, network streams and online wallpapers (Pexels).\n• The privacy lock uses your phone\'s own biometric/lock screen; fingerprints are never seen or stored by the app.</string>
    <string name="about_perms">Permissions</string>
    <string name="about_perms_txt">• Media (video/audio): to find and play your files\n• All files access: to manage, rename, delete and move files, recycle bin and downloads\n• Internet: browser, downloads, streams, online wallpapers\n• Notifications &amp; foreground service: playback and download controls\n• Display over other apps: floating player\n• Biometric: privacy lock\n• Wake lock &amp; battery optimisation: keep playback running in the background</string>
    <string name="about_lic">Open-source licenses</string>
    <string name="about_lic_txt">HM player is built with these open-source libraries:\n• AndroidX Media3 (ExoPlayer) – Apache License 2.0\n• Glide – BSD / Apache 2.0\n• OkHttp – Apache License 2.0\n• Material Components for Android – Apache License 2.0\n• AndroidX (Core, AppCompat, RecyclerView, ViewPager2, Biometric) – Apache License 2.0</string>
